## STEP 4: DEVELOPMENT ENVIRONMENT SETUP

### Create Project Directory and Virtual Environment
SSH into the Pi, then run:
```bash
# Create project directory
mkdir -p ~/thesis
cd ~/thesis

# Create virtual environment
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
```

### Install System Dependencies
These are needed by the DHT22 sensor library and OpenCV:
```bash
sudo apt install -y libgpiod2 python3-libgpiod
sudo apt install -y libcap-dev
sudo apt install -y v4l-utils
sudo apt install -y libopencv-dev python3-opencv
```

### Install Python Packages
```bash
pip install --upgrade pip

# Sensor libraries
pip install adafruit-circuitpython-dht
pip install RPi.GPIO                     # For digital GPIO soil moisture

# Camera and CV
pip install opencv-python-headless numpy pillow

# Edge Impulse inference
pip install edge_impulse_linux

# Data transmission (optional, for future use)
pip install paho-mqtt requests

# Web dashboard (optional)
pip install flask
```

### Future: When ADS1115 ADC Arrives
```bash
# Activate venv first
cd ~/thesis && source venv/bin/activate

# Install ADC library
pip install adafruit-circuitpython-ads1x15

# Then change SOIL_SENSOR_MODE to "analog" in config/settings.py
```

### Create Project Structure
```bash
cd ~/thesis
mkdir -p src config logs data models
touch src/__init__.py
```

### Verify Installation
```bash
python3 -c "
import adafruit_dht
import cv2
import RPi.GPIO as GPIO
print('adafruit_dht OK')
print(f'OpenCV {cv2.__version__} OK')
print('RPi.GPIO OK')
print('All core dependencies installed successfully!')
"
```

### Project Structure
```
~/thesis/
├── venv/                          # Python virtual environment
├── models/
│   └── your-edge-impulse-model.eim  # Edge Impulse model file
├── src/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── sensors.py                 # DHT22 + soil moisture (digital/analog)
│   ├── camera.py                  # USB webcam capture
│   ├── inference.py               # Edge Impulse model inference
│   ├── transmit.py                # Data transmission (WiFi/NB-IoT)
│   └── main.py                    # Main monitoring loop
├── config/
│   └── settings.py                # All configuration in one place
├── logs/                          # Runtime logs
├── data/                          # Saved sensor data and images
└── requirements.txt               # Python dependencies
```
